{"v":4,"catch":"古老的魚“Sacabambaspis”變成遊戲！\n控制很簡單，但遊戲非常具有挑戰性！\n試試一下，看看你能遊多遠！","desc":"「Sacabambaspis」並不是一個很好的游泳者。 它會自動游泳，但同時會不斷上升到海面。\n按下按鈕使其潛入海底。\n試著在不撞到任何障礙物的情況下盡可能走得更遠。\n\n如果你升得太高、跳得太低或撞到障礙物，遊戲就結束了。\n（打到氣泡就沒事了！）\n\n當你繼續游泳時，它會變得越來越困難。\n\n可能會變成夜晚，也可能回到過去或未來！？\n\n打破你的高分並向你的朋友炫耀！","publisher":"MBA INTERNATIONAL","release":"2023-11-21","genres":["動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.3GB / Switch 0.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8b5c90efe8040e999f121a4492490569cb8f5a3d68e953a08a252dbf217db754.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/39cded6e468d00a326b7b39fb2a1782cba0a0af790e03d81ba9c4ba5edc956bc.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/209264eb955ccc801bf5e4efbaea2cffbef6c4365e09a96c242eb153a096ba84.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c2645a875edb1f4f7a0c38dbe8f0bffb6e7c95388b814f6d5d44e87c953ec914.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dcded0f49ecb640c283ce97185bd7d6cdb0e91798605fdeffadc0609a25bd703.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c3e95878d6161ffafb80a015090f601bbe4e3443110e0d13ecd22716353892f4.jpg"],"titleId":"010032901d346000","dlc":[],"vids":["i3IH5tFjzOo"]}